        "instruction": "Find the name of the virtual market/platform where the developer's game was released in 'prozilla.md', and find the core framework/tech stack mentioned in 'info.md'. Combine these findings and record them on the first line of 'text.txt' in the format 'Platform: [platform], Tech: [tech_stack]' and save the file. Leave the application open.",
