    {
        "task_id": "prozilla_task_A_39",
        "instruction": "Open 'fizzbuzz.sh' inside the 'Scripts' folder using the Text Editor, modify the default iteration range (COUNT) from its original value to 50, and save the file. Leave the application open.",
